SUMMARY:All Class Club Ride (Long) LV Ephrata Dutch Long (39H)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nThis is the September All Club Ride Long for the A\
 , B\, and C riders. Following the ride\, please join us at Stubby's which 
 for food\, drinks and fellowship\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikecl
 ub.net/cue/lv-ephrata-dutch-long-39h/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/cue/lv-ephrata-dutch-long-39h/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the adve
 rtised average speed for the [Ride Classifications](https://lancasterbikec
 lub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325156). This is 
 intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride
  leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional re
 groupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start.\nPlease do not
  join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exce
 ed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join
  a faster group. If maintaining the advertised average pace is beyond your
  current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nH
 elmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair ki
 t (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing 
 around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup 
 RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club
  member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide 
 by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://lancasterbikeclub
 .net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nGuidance if
  an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3162165
 90/
