SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: CV New Holland-Airport 3 (43F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**RIDE LEADER: Jon Hartun
 g**\n**SWEEP:** John Cardos\n**Cue and Ride with GPS link:**\n[https://rou
 tes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-new-holland-airport-3-43f/](https://route
 s.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-new-holland-airport-3-43f/)\n\n**Be Safe\, 
 Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\n**43 miles\, flat\, less than 1500 feet 
 elevation gain. The ride leader will ride at the advertised pace of approx
 . 12-14mph on average. The front 25 miles has food/snack/water stops avail
 able. Sheetz\, Speedway\, Stauffer's (Grocery)\, Shoppes at Kissel Hill**\
 n**(Starbucks\, McDonalds\, etc.). Last half no identified food/water stop
 s. Some riders may ride faster than the leader\, so we'll likely break int
 o one or more smaller groups with stops to regroup periodically. Please st
 ay with other riders in your pace group so everyone has someone to ride wi
 th and nobody is riding solo.**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Pl
 ease bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/C
 O2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, 
 we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Be
 ing on**\n**Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here** [Membe
 r Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_i
 d=257148)\n\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of 
 Conduct:** [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.asp
 x?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\n**Guidance if an incident
  occurs:** [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3166052
