 -linden-coffee-23f/)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis i
 s a Casual D Class ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised avera
 ge speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the m
 ain goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together 
 with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align
  to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not will
 ing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be ri
 ding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 1
 2-14 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider jo
 ining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please br
 ing water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 infl
 ator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require 
 LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meet
 up does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://
