SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- WE Wild Batch Bistro (26R) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Show-and-Go\
 nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating sta
 rt location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile rout
 es\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for r
 efreshment/coffee mid-route at [Wild Batch Bistro](https://www.facebook.co
 m/thewildbatch)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a sing
 le pace.\nThere will be multiple regroup points during the ride.\nThe Coff
 eeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in on
 e group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned stop
  to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to 
 avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.
 \n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](
 https://ridewithgps.com/routes/33891550?privacy_code=yWE9u4n4Q3gD8hRp&via=
 lB7cGZ6xdG3NrmYbFe9gmg) New Route (sort of)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No e
 ar buds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire leve
 rs\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wa
 iver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this r
 ide.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](h
 ttps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\
 n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](ht
 tps://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress
 .com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride
  Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case of ac
 cident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpr
 essClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAcce
 ssKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&response-content-dispositi
 on=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4
 w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
